Every file that adapts Agentic Inbox code keeps Cloudflare's copyright header
and adds a line stating that it was modified, when, and what changed. The list
of adapted files is maintained below; a file not listed contains no Agentic
Inbox code.

Adapted files:
  src/mailbox/folders.ts   from shared/folders.ts
                           (drafts folder id is `drafts`; six fixed system
                           folders; display helpers and tool descriptions
                           removed)
  src/mailbox/schema.ts    the migration runner, from
                           workers/durableObject/migrations.ts
                           (tracking table renamed mailbox_migrations; every
                           migration inside transactionSync; BEGIN/COMMIT
                           stripping removed)
  src/mail/html-text.ts    stripHtmlToText, from workers/lib/email-helpers.ts
                           (also decodes common HTML entities; used only for
                           the snippet sealed inside a message header)

packages/mail-crypto and packages/mail-outbound contain no Agentic Inbox
code.
